SUMMARY:3rd All India Conference of East Asian Studies
LOCATION:Conference Room I\, IIC main\, India International Centre\, 40 M
 ax Mueller Marg\, Lodhi Gardens\, New Delhi 110003
URL:https://iicdelhi.in/programmes/3rd-all-india-conference-east-asian-st
 udies
DESCRIPTION:Dissonances in the World Order: Implications for Indo-Pacific
  & East Asia\nKeynote Address by Prof. Kan Kimura\, Graduate School of In
 ternational Cooperation Studies\, Kobe University\nFollowed by Thematic d
 iscussions and a Special Lecture by eminent academicians\, policy experts
  and researchers on contemporary issues in East Asian Studies\, internati
 onal politics\, regional security\, technology\, economics and the enviro
 nment.\nThe conference will examine the evolving geopolitical\, economic 
 and strategic landscape of East Asia and the Indo-Pacific\, with a partic
 ular focus on Japan's role in shaping a free\, open and rules-based regio
 nal order. Discussions will explore regional security\, economic resilien
 ce\, technology\, climate and multilateral cooperation.\nFor the detailed
  programme\, please\nclick here\n(Collaboration: Institute of Chinese Stu
 dies and Japan Foundation)\n\nhttps://iicdelhi.in/programmes/3rd-all-indi
 a-conference-east-asian-studies
CATEGORIES:talk\,sociology
END:VEVENT
