BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:27b246994b7a5d92@delhi-events
DTSTAMP:20260730T213746Z
DTSTART:20260823T133000Z
DTEND:20260823T153000Z
SUMMARY:Dastan - e - Raahi
LOCATION:The Stein Auditorium\, India Habitat Centre\, Lodhi Road\, New D
 elhi 110003
URL:https://indiahabitat.org/Events_details/1359
DESCRIPTION:Dastan - e - Raahi (Hindustani\, Urdu\, Bhojpuri/90 mins with
  interval) Adapted by Darain Shahidi . Performed by Darain Shahidi & Raje
 sh Kumar . Dir. Mahmood Farooqui . Produced by Anusha Rizvi . Celebrating
  the centenary of the great Hindi writer Dr. Rahi Masoom Raza\, this Dast
 angoi performance traces his extraordinary journey from his childhood in 
 Gangauli to his years as an uncompromising academic and the legendary wri
 ter who gave us the rustic soul of Aadha Gaon \, a landmark of Hindi lite
 rature. It narrates his remarkable career as a writer and lyricist in the
  Bombay film industry\, culminating in his screenplay and dialogues for B
 . R. Chopra's epoch-defining television serial Mahabharata . Prod. Dastan
 goi Collective . Tickets at Rs.500\, Rs.350 & Rs.200 are available online
  on bookmyshow.com and at the Habitat Programmes desk .\n\nhttps://indiah
 abitat.org/Events_details/1359
CATEGORIES:performance\,literature\,theatre
END:VEVENT
